"""A partial approximation using formatting and document-opening patterns.

Blank lines after reasoning/tool tags give positive pulses. At document
starts, possessives and heading hashes are negative; script and word-shape
rules supply coarser baselines. Bare import words and the opening Question
label are negative. Literal opening '12' and 'Title:' have sharper responses.
